<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">glass-scale-helm</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A steel helm scaled brow to nape in Obelisk lenses: harder and far
lighter than plate, and it turns a little of each blow back on the
attacker.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 48)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> steel ingot (x3), coal dust (x1), obelisk lens (x12)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help blacksmithing</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
